---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import awards from "../assets/awards.png";
---

<Layout title="Scholarships & Awards | Anson Chan">
<main class="page-container">
    
<!-- 1. HERO SECTION -->
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-text">
<h1>Scholarships & Awards</h1>

<p class="bio-text">
A heartfelt thanks to the many donors, organisations, professors, mentors and collaborators who have been supporting me.
Since my undergraduate years, I have been fortunate to receive more than 15 scholarships and awards with an estimated amount of USD 300,000
across Hong Kong, the UK, China, Australia and Denmark.
</p>

<p class="bio-text">
The generous funding enables me to pursue my research, teaching, industry and community projects.
It also recognises my leadership and committment in creating positve impacts in society.
</p>
</div>

<div class="hero-photo">
<img 
  src={awards.src} 
  alt="Awards Page Profile"
  class="profile-photo"
  />

</div>
</section>

<section class="awards-list">

<!-- Item 0: Cam West Hub -->
<article class="news-card">
<div class="news-thumb">
<img src="/awards/cam-westhub.png" alt="Cambridge West Hub" />
</div>
        
<div class="news-content">
<span class="news-date">Jul 2026</span>
<h3><a href="https://www.westcambridgehub.uk/whats-on/small-grants-programme/" class="news-title-link">
Cambridge West Hub Smart Grants Programme
</a></h3>

<p>
Organised LLM+ Research Day at the University of Cambridge West Hub, with 30+ participants
joining 3 leading researchers in VR training, Operations Management and the Theory of Evaluation in the age of GenAI.
</p>

</div>
</article>

